{"unit_id": "tag:01NM:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节概述一个概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>的构造方法，即粘合（glueing）齐次谱（homogeneous spectra）<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>遍历<MATH_0004>的仿射开集（affine opens）。我们首先证明，<MATH_0005>在仿射开集（affines）上各个取值的齐次谱（homogeneous spectra）组成一族合适的概形（schemes），如引理<REF_0001>所述。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectra", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectra", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所构造态射的源与目标。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "本节所构造的概形之间的箭头。"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "用各局部齐次谱构造所述态射的方法。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectra", "target_term": "齐次谱", "context": "构造中所粘合的局部谱。"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "局部构造所遍历的开集。"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指前述作为取值范围的仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectra", "target_term": "齐次谱", "context": "取值的谱组成所述概形族。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "齐次谱所组成的一族对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01NO:statement", "translation": "在情形<REF_0001>下，假设<MATH_0001>是仿射开集（affine opens）。设<MATH_0002>，<MATH_0003>。分次（graded）环（rings）的映射（map）<MATH_0004>诱导出态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>，且图表（diagram）<MATH_0006>是笛卡尔（cartesian）的。此外，存在典范（canonical）同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0007>，它们与乘法（multiplication）映射（maps）相容。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "cartesian", "target_term": "笛卡尔"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "引理对所给开集的假设。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定映射所涉及的环。"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "分次映射的源与目标。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "诱导概形态射的分次环映射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由分次环映射诱导的箭头。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "引理断言具有笛卡尔性质的图表。"}, {"source_term": "cartesian", "target_term": "笛卡尔", "context": "陈述所给图表具有纤维积性质。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "限定引理给出的同构。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "引理给出与乘法映射相容的同构。"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法", "context": "限定同构与之相容的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "与所给同构相容的乘法映射。"}], "notes": []}
